    "languageQuestions": {
        "title": "Naamne dow",
        "titleHighlight": "Ɗemngal",
        "intro": "Ƴeew naamne lolluɗe dow ɗemngal Fulfulde, celluka mum, kuutoragol mum e keeriiɗi mum.",
        "q1": "Hol sereendu hakkunde Pulaar e Fulfulde ?",
        "a1": "Pulaar e Fulfulde ko ɗemngal gootol, ɗemngal Fulɓe. Pulaar ko innde huutorteende semmbe e Afirik Hirnaange (Senegaal, Muritani, Gine), tawi Fulfulde ko innde kuuftidinɗe mbaadi ɗemngal ngal kala e Afirik.",
        "q2": "Ɗo yimɓe nayo kaali Fulfulde ?",
        "a2": "Fulfulde ina haalee e yimɓe miliyoŋaaji 40 haa 50 e nder Afirik, gila Senegaal haa Sudaan. Ko gootal e ɗemɗe ɓurɗe saakde e nder Afirik.",
        "q3": "Hol alkulal huutorteengal ngam winndude Fulfulde ?",
        "a3": "Fulfulde ina winndee e alkulal Latin e maande keeriiɗe (ɓ, ɗ, ŋ, ƴ, ɲ, ñ). Alkulal Arab (Ajami) ina huutoree kadi e gannde. Goomu Fulo & Wiɗto huutorii alkulal Latin moƴƴitinaangal.",
        "q4": "Ko ngoni gaaluuji innde e Fulfulde ?",
        "a4": "Fulfulde ina jogii yuɓɓo gaaluuji innde (ko ina tolnoo e 25) ɗe ɗowata nanondire celluka. Kala innde ina jeyaa e gaalu gootu ngu ɗowata inneteeɗe, sifaaji e mbaydiiji gollal. Ko ɗum gootal e keeriiɗi ɓurɗi laaɓde e ɗemngal ngal.",
        "q5": "No siigorde gollal gollortee e Fulfulde ?",
        "a5": "Siigorde gollal e Fulfulde ina heewi sanne. Golle ina wayloo mbaydi sabu sahaa, ngonka, daande (gollirde, golleede, hakkunde) e baɗoowo. Yuɓɓo gollal ngal ina jogii kadi ɓeyditte baylitte maana gollal ngal (sabaabu, peccindirgal, teeŋtingal, ekn).",
        "q6": "Hol to neɗɗo waawi janngude Fulfulde ?",
        "a6": "Ballitine keewɗe ina ngoodi : janngirɗe jaaɓi-haaɗtirde, pelle pine Fulɓe, e kuutorɗe geese hono saggitorde Goomu Fulo & Wiɗto. Lowre amin ina faanditii wallitde janngude e reentaade ɗemngal ngal."
    },
